s=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754960/extras/9508fef9ca799e87144df6a04006fc99.poster.avif?t=1761671841\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754960/extras/9508fef9ca799e87144df6a04006fc99.webm?t=1761671841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754960/extras/9508fef9ca799e87144df6a04006fc99.mp4?t=1761671841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
